    icon: '🃏',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: '1. Dealer gives 3 cards to each player, 4 face-up on table. 2. Declaration phase: players may announce Chorizo, Flor, Báciga, or Escalera before play. 3. In turn, each player plays one card to capture table cards that sum to 15, or adds a card to the table. 4. Escoba: capturing all table cards scores bonus. 5. When hands empty, dealer deals 3 more cards; repeat until deck exhausted. 6. Score: Oros (coins), Cartas (cards), Setenta (sevens). First to 21 wins.',
    Player: '1. Dealer gives 3 cards to each player, 4 face-up on table. 2. Declaration phase: players may announce Chorizo, Flor, Báciga, or Escalera before play. 3. In turn, each player plays one card to capture table cards that sum to 15, or adds a card to the table. 4. Escoba: capturing all table cards scores bonus. 5. When hands empty, dealer deals 3 more cards; repeat until deck exhausted. 6. Score: Oros (coins), Cartas (cards), Setenta (sevens). First to 21 wins.',
    objective: 'Be the first to reach 21 points through captures and hand declarations.',
    gameplay: '1. Dealer gives 3 cards to each player, 4 face-up on table. 2. Declaration phase: players may announce Chorizo, Flor, Báciga, or Escalera before play. 3. In turn, each player plays one card to capture table cards that sum to 15, or adds a card to the table. 4. Escoba: capturing all table cards scores bonus. 5. When hands empty, dealer deals 3 more cards; repeat until deck exhausted. 6. Score: Oros (coins), Cartas (cards), Setenta (sevens). First to 21 wins.',
    keyRules: [
      '21 points wins the game.',
      'The 7 of Coins is the most valuable individual card.',
      'If the initial 4 cards on the table sum to 15 or 30, the Dealer takes them as 1 or 2 Escobas immediately.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: false,
