    turnFlow: '1. Dealer gives 3 cards to each player, 4 face-up on table. 2. Declaration phase: players may announce Chorizo, Flor, Báciga, or Escalera before play. 3. In turn, each player plays one card to capture table cards that sum to 15, or adds a card to the table. 4. Escoba: capturing all table cards scores bonus. 5. When hands empty, dealer deals 3 more cards; repeat until deck exhausted. 6. Score: Oros (coins), Cartas (cards), Setenta (sevens). First to 21 wins.',
